END MOVES REPORT

  Congratulations!  You have reached level 5 in Sageness.  At levels 5 and 
up, there is not necessarily an increase in the chance to invent something.  
Instead, the Sage attracts a company of philosphers and builds a University 
in his province of birth.  Your characters of this exalted level are awarded 
a new Advanced Ability: 
  SAGE'S UNIVERSITY:  The Sage gains an additional plus 1 level when 
researching inventions if he is at his University (the location is shown in 
the Characters listing).  All percentage bonuses are cumulative.


